  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi-country scale-up of RCRC community-based surveillance with Nyss</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to reduce the impact of epidemic outbreaks through early detection and response to diseases with epidemic potential, by scaling up community-based surveillance (CBS) projects. To facilitate and elevate ongoing and future CBS efforts, NorCross has developed Nyss; a custom software platform for CBS. The use of CBS is more valuable than ever in today&apos;s climate change situation, where increased likelihood of natural disasters and deforestation can lead to increased health risks.</narrative>
  </description>
